@Valenwood Ping 

*A gathering at Tree-Ring Trading Circle **in Woodhearth** has begun for a public, interactive lecture on Perchance in Bosmeri life and magic.*

(contact `@rosehead` for phasing or questions)

> > *An Ohmes khajiit can be found in the Sugar Bowl in Rimmen, checking in a room and having a meal.*
[Small, open RP in Rimmen, local characters suggested, but not required. Message `@rosehead` with questions]
@Elsweyr Ping

@Hammerfell Ping
*The warmth of Abah's Landing harkens! What tales will you tell? What rumors will you hear? What connections and friendships might you make? Find out as the city comes alive!*
> **Roleplayers Unlimited's** weekly Abah's Landing RP is starting in the courtyard of the **Hew's Mane tavern**! Feel free to stop by, or start your own RP scene in Abah's Landing! You can whisper ``@Nitewalker314`` for a port until <t:1794623400:t>. > -# Open vampires, werewolves, daedra, etc. should expect potentially hostile encounters in Abah's Landing.

> *Three khajiit cross paths in the Baandari Bazaar in Rimmen!*
[Small, open RP in Rimmen, local characters suggested, but not required. Message `@rosehead` to join group, as the RP is in /g]
@Elsweyr Ping

> *The Nightbox's sugar lounge, Tenurr Jana, is currently open in Rimmen. People in the know on Rimmen's nightlife might stop in for a drink, or to smoke some moonsugar, and chat.*
[**Note: This is a mature setting. 18+ only, IC and OOC** Open RP in Rimmen, local characters suggested, but not required. Message `@rosehead` or use the script `/script JumpToSpecificHouse("@Rosehead",124)` to join]
@Elsweyr Ping

@Valenwood Ping 

*A gathering at Tree-Ring Trading Circle **in Woodhearth** has begun for a public ritual called The Rites of Windfall. All are welcome to join, bosmer and traveler alike.*

(contact `@rosehead` for phasing or questions)

